#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:2
msgid "Sponsors of Read the Docs"
msgstr "Read the Docs 的赞助者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:4
msgid ""
"Running Read the Docs isn't free, and the site wouldn't be where it is today"
" without generous support of our sponsors. Below is a list of all the folks "
"who have helped the site financially, in order of the date they first "
"started supporting us."
msgstr ""
"运营 Read the Docs "
"并非免费，若没有赞助者的慷慨支持，站点不会有今天的成就。以下列出所有在财务上帮助过本站的人，按他们首次开始支持我们的时间排序。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:10
msgid "Current sponsors"
msgstr "当前赞助者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:12
msgid ""
"`AWS`_ - They cover all of our hosting expenses every month.  This is a "
"pretty large sum of money, averaging around $5,000/mo."
msgstr "`AWS`_ - 他们每月承担我们全部的托管费用。这是一笔相当可观的资金，平均每月约 5,000 美元。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:13
msgid ""
"`Cloudflare`_ - Cloudflare is providing us with an enterprise plan of their "
"SSL for SaaS Providers product that enables us to provide SSL certificates "
"for custom domains."
msgstr ""
"`Cloudflare`_ - Cloudflare 为我们提供其 SSL for SaaS Providers "
"产品的企业级套餐，使我们能够为自定义域名提供 SSL 证书。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Chan Zuckerberg Initiative`_ - Through their \"Essential Open Source "
"Software for Science\" programme, they fund our ongoing efforts to improve "
"scientific documentation and make Read the Docs a better service for "
"scientific projects."
msgstr ""
"`Chan Zuckerberg Initiative`_ - 他们通过\"Essential Open Source Software for "
"Science\"计划资助我们持续改进科学文档的工作，让 Read the Docs 成为科研项目更好的服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:16
msgid "You? (Email us at hello@readthedocs.org for more info)"
msgstr "你呢？（发邮件至 hello@readthedocs.org 了解更多）"

